  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.20.0: Loam.Data DataGrid row selection — opt-in SelectionMode (None/Single/Multiple), SelectedItem, SelectedItems, and a SelectionChanged event. Click selects; Multiple supports Ctrl-toggle and Shift-range (mouse or keyboard); selection is highlighted and survives sort/filter/page rebuilds by item identity. Ctrl+C copies the selected rows when a selection exists. Defaults to Single (preserves prior behavior). Additive. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
